(106, 3, 4, 67, '<p><em><strong>Statements</strong>:</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(i) All fans are rooms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(ii) No room is green.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(iii) Some windows are green.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>Conclusions:</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(I) Some windows are fan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(II) Some windows are rooms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(III) Some fans are green.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(IV) No green is fan.</p>\r\n', '<p>In each of the questions below are given few statements followed by few conclusions numbered. Considering the given statements to be true, read all conclusions and then decide which of the given conclusion logically follow the given statement.</p>\r\n', 'No', 1, 829, 0, 0, NULL),
(107, 3, 4, 67, '<p><strong><em>Statements:</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(i) Some books are pen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(ii) No pen is pencil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><em>Conclusions:</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(I) Some books are pencil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(II) No book is pencil.</p>\r\n', '', 'No', 1, 832, 0, 0, NULL),
